  },
  {
    "id": 1022003010070,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "今日は透ちゃんのお仕事に付いて行って、\r\nそのまま戻らないって──……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200301/1022003010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、そのつもりだったんだけどさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さっき、はづきさんから連絡もらって\r\n小糸、まだいるみたいだっていうから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003010080,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あ…………\r\nそ、そうだったんですね、ごめんなさい",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200301/1022003010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003010090,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わたしのせいで\r\n戻ってくることになっちゃって……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200301/1022003010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、違うよ！\r\nそうじゃないんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸に話したいことがあってさ\r\n時間取らなきゃって、思ってたんだけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "せっかく小糸がまだいるなら、その話をして\r\nそれから送っていこうかなって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003010100,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あ、そ、それならよかったです……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200301/1022003010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003010110,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "で、でも話って……\r\nわ、わたし……何かしちゃいましたか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200301/1022003010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、いや！\r\nそうでもなくて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003010120,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200301/1022003010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──小糸\r\n『G.R.A.D.』に挑戦してみないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003010130,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………！\r\nぴぇ、ぐ、『G.R.A.D.』、ですか……！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200301/1022003010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、小糸も聞いたことくらいはあるだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003010140,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "は、はい……！\r\nあります、けど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200301/1022003010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003010150,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "でも、あの、それに\r\n……わたしが出ても、いいんですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200301/1022003010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もちろん！\r\nじゃなきゃ言わないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だけど出場するなら、ユニットとしてじゃなくて\r\n一人でステージに立つことになる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003010160,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あ…………",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200301/1022003010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "当然、今まで以上にしっかりサポートしていくつもりだし\r\n俺にできることはなんでもするつもりだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ステージに立つのは一人でも、\r\n一人で挑まなきゃいけないってわけじゃない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003010170,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200301/1022003010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ってことで、すぐに答えを出さなくてもいい\r\nゆっくり考えてみてから──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003010180,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あ、あの……！\r\nあ、え、えっとですね……わたし",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200301/1022003010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003010190,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "──わたし、やりたいです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200301/1022003010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……！\r\n本当か…………！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、いや……すまん\r\n焦ることは無いんだぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003010200,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "いえ、わたし\r\nやりたいんです",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200301/1022003010200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003010210,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……みんなに元気を\r\nあげられるアイドルになるには",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200301/1022003010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003010220,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ちゃんと、何かのために……\r\n頑張らないと……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200301/1022003010220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003010230,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "だから……\r\n『G.R.A.D.』のために頑張りたいんです",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200301/1022003010230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003010240,
